@startuml SSD_UC2_RecordDecision
title SSD - UC2 Record a proposal decision
hide footbox

actor ":Proposal Editor" as PE
participant ":Production Record System" as S

PE -> S : selectProposal(proposal)
S --> PE : proposal details, earlier decisions and conditions

PE -> S : recordDecision(proposal, outcome, conditions, note)
alt outcome = accepted
  S --> PE : proposal shown as accepted with its conditions (GS1, GS14)
else outcome = rejected
  S --> PE : proposal shown as rejected, with any reason (GS13)
else outcome = returned for revision
  S --> PE : proposal shown as returned; open for a later decision
else outcome = held for future consideration
  S --> PE : proposal shown as held, not as awaiting a decision (GS15, A13)
else proposal already accepted or rejected
  S --> PE : decision not recorded: reopening depends on Q2
end

note right of S
  Decision date and editor are recorded
  by the system, not entered (FR3).
  Incomplete proposal: decision allowed (Q1, E1).
  Abandoned (E3): no system event is sent,
  so no decision is recorded (GS16).
end note
@enduml